<title>HONG KONG: Bankers Trust names S. Asia operations chief.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust names S. Asia operations chief.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gabriel Teo has joined Bankers Trust as head of its South Asia operations, the company announced Tuesday.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Bankers Trust, Teo served as country manager for Chase Manhattan Bank's Singapore activities. Before that, he spent 17 years at Citibank.</p>
<p>Teo will report to Tim Rattray, chairman of Bankers Trust Asia.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
